        "description": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Few games have generated as much momentum this year as <em>Forza Horizon 6</em>. The latest entry in Playground Games' acclaimed racing series has earned widespread critical praise, including a fantastic <a href=\"https://www.gamespot.com/reviews/forza-horizon-6-review-dopamine-highway/1900-6418489/\">8/10 review from GameSpot</a>, while also setting new player engagement records across the franchise. For a series that has consistently defined the open-world racing genre, it's another major achievement \u2014 and one that reinforces <em>Forza Horizon 6</em>'s place as one of the biggest games in the industry right now.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure data-wp-interactive=\"core/image\" data-wp-context=\"{ &quot;core&quot;: { &quot;image&quot;: { &quot;initialized&quot;: true } } }\" class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-ref-id=\"1790296\" data-wp-on--click=\"actions.core.image.showLightbox\" style=\"cursor: zoom-in\" height=\"576\" width=\"1024\" src=\"https://www.gamespot.com/wp-content/",
